sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant Flags as FeatureFlags
    participant Cache as DataStore
    participant Remote as Remote config

    App->>Flags: read bool("new_search", default=false)
    Flags->>Cache: cached value?
    Cache-->>Flags: cached OR none
    Flags-->>App: cached value OR default (never blocks)
    par background
        Flags->>Remote: fetch (Ch 30/44)
        Remote-->>Flags: new config (rollout-resolved)
        Flags->>Cache: cache it
        Note over Flags: activate at a safe point -> stable next read
    end
